        "en": "Sender: My submission might be a bit off-topic\nEditor: No. I think it's actually really interesting. Even though there's no umbrella in the photo, you can imagine there are a bunch of them behind that sign. I don't think it's off-topic at all.\nSender: Yeah, exactly. I really liked that photo at the time. There were a lot of really cute umbrellas there."
